---
import Section from '@components/ui/Section.astro';
import Card from '@components/ui/Card.astro';
import siteData from '@data/site.json';
---

<Section background="default" containerClass="!py-20 md:!py-28">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
    {/* 左 2 列：俱乐部概览文字 */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 reveal" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0">
      <span
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-3
               glass text-xidian-500"
      >
        <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-xidian-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        About Us
      </span>
      <h2 class="heading-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50 mt-3">
        俱乐部
        <span class="text-gradient-xidian bg-clip-text text-transparent">概览</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mt-6 text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-300">
        <p>
          西电浪潮俱乐部（<strong class="text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">ISC</strong>）成立于
          {siteData.founded} 年，以企业资源为依托，为同学们打造一个
          <strong class="text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">提升就业技能</strong>
          与
          <strong class="text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">增加知识储备</strong> 的平台。
        </p>
        <p>
          通过技术培训、学术讲座、浪潮集团参观访问、技术茶话会等活动，俱乐部已为往届同学提供高水平的
          <strong>机器学习 / 数据挖掘 / 算法竞赛</strong> 平台；并给予包括但不限于
          <strong class="text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">实习、就业、升学</strong>
          等方面的指导和帮助。
        </p>
        <p>
          目前主要由 <strong class="text-inspur-600 dark:text-cyan-300">技术部</strong>
          和 <strong class="text-xidian-500 dark:text-orange-300">运营部</strong>
          两大模块组成。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 右 3 列：部门 Bento 卡片 */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">
      {/* 技术部：大卡 */}
      <Card class="group glass glass-hover md:col-span-2 !rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-inspur-500 to-cyan-500 opacity-15 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-inspur-500 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl shadow-lg">
              <span aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-display text-2xl text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">技术部</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300 leading-relaxed">
            我们针对各个组别进行相关技术的学习运用，帮助每个同学创造更多可能。
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              ['Web 组', 'AI 组', 'Agent 组', 'ACM 组'].map((g) => (
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-inspur-50 text-inspur-700 dark:bg-inspur-900/40 dark:text-cyan-300">
                  {g}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
          <a
            href="/tech"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-inspur-600 dark:text-cyan-300 hover:gap-2 transition-all"
          >
            查看更多
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>

      {/* 运营部：小卡 */}
      <Card class="group glass glass-hover md:col-span-1 !rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-xidian-500 to-orange-500 opacity-15 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative p-6">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-xidian-500 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-lg mb-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true">📢</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-display text-xl text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">运营部</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300 leading-relaxed">
            打理人、护航者。挖掘成员潜力，让所有人各尽其才。
          </p>
          <a
            href="/operate"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-xidian-500 dark:text-orange-300 hover:gap-2 transition-all"
          >
            了解更多
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
